Subject: [PATCH v2 1/2] kbuild: merge bounds.h and asm-offsets.h rules
Date: Mon,  5 Jan 2015 15:57:15 +0900
Message-Id: <1420441036-5289-2-git-send-email-yamada.m@jp.panasonic.com>
